      "problem": "Find the solution to the inequality $-1\\le 3x+5\\le 8.$\n\n{{field-1}}{{field-2}}\n$x\\,\\le $\n{{field-3}}",
      "worked_solution": "We isolate $x$ by applying the addition principle, as usual:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-1 & \\le 3x+5\\le 8 \\\\ -1-5 & \\le 3x+5-5\\le 8-5 \\\\ -6 & \\le 3x\\le 3 \\\\ \\frac{-6}{3} & \\le \\frac{3x}{3}\\le \\frac{3}{3} \\\\ -2 & \\le x\\le 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $-2\\le x\\le 1.$",
